galleoncore (0.3.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add bundled English, French, German and Spanish Bosun interface catalogs.
  * Detect the system language and remember instant UI and tray language changes.
  * Add adaptive tab widths with one-second transitions and visible selection.
  * Preserve unfinished shortcut edits during backend refreshes and language changes.
  * Include once-per-version update prompts and Launchpad build-test fixes.

